        <mxCell id="6wiaA6puWI5cDe3y5h9X-24" value="컴파일하는데 오래걸릴 수도있으니&lt;div&gt;맨 처음에 실행하기&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
